{
  "nl": "角色管理：查询表单分 2 列，新增编辑弹窗宽度 720px，弹窗里的表单也分 2 列；表格展示角色名、角色编码、数据权限范围、创建时间；支持新增、编辑、删除、查看。",
  "nlEn": "Role management: the query form is 2 columns; the add/edit dialog is 720px wide and its form is also 2 columns; the table shows role name, role code, data permission scope, and creation time; supports add, edit, delete, and view.",
  "fixedFields": ["roleName", "roleCode", "dataScope", "createdAt"],
  "pinnedDims": ["propSet", "actions", "fieldSpan"],
  "config": {
    "name": "RoleManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/roles",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "roleName",
        "label": "角色名",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "querySpan": 12,
        "formSpan": 12
      },
      {
        "prop": "roleCode",
        "label": "角色编码",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "querySpan": 12,
        "formSpan": 12
      },
      {
        "prop": "dataScope",
        "label": "数据权限范围",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "querySpan": 12,
        "formSpan": 12,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "全部",
            "value": "all"
          },
          {
            "label": "本部门",
            "value": "dept"
          },
          {
            "label": "本部门及以下",
            "value": "dept_and_child"
          },
          {
            "label": "仅本人",
            "value": "self"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "createdAt",
        "label": "创建时间",
        "formtype": "DatePicker",
        "inForm": false
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete",
      "view"
    ],
    "dialogs": {
      "add": {
        "title": "新增角色",
        "width": 720,
        "formItems": [
          { "prop": "roleName", "label": "角色名", "formtype": "Input", "formSpan": 12 },
          { "prop": "roleCode", "label": "角色编码", "formtype": "Input", "formSpan": 12 },
          { "prop": "dataScope", "label": "数据权限范围", "formtype": "Select", "formSpan": 12,
            "dataOptions": [
              { "label": "全部", "value": "all" },
              { "label": "本部门", "value": "dept" },
              { "label": "本部门及以下", "value": "dept_and_child" },
              { "label": "仅本人", "value": "self" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "edit": {
        "title": "编辑角色",
        "width": 720,
        "formItems": [
          { "prop": "roleName", "label": "角色名", "formtype": "Input", "formSpan": 12 },
          { "prop": "roleCode", "label": "角色编码", "formtype": "Input", "formSpan": 12 },
          { "prop": "dataScope", "label": "数据权限范围", "formtype": "Select", "formSpan": 12,
            "dataOptions": [
              { "label": "全部", "value": "all" },
              { "label": "本部门", "value": "dept" },
              { "label": "本部门及以下", "value": "dept_and_child" },
              { "label": "仅本人", "value": "self" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": "dialog width + 2-column add/edit form（列宽由字段级 formSpan 决定）。2026-10-29 把「查询表单分 2 列」写进 NL：gold 的三个可查询字段同时带 querySpan:12 与 formSpan:12，可原文只说「表单分 2 列」—— 模型只给 formSpan 是照 NL 的正确读法，却被 querySpan 判负。补 NL 而不是删 gold，是为了保住 querySpan 这条测量。2026-11-04 补上 dialogs.add/edit 的 formItems：声明 dialogs 即进入显式模式，三端 normalizedDialogs 原样返回、生成器也只拷贝真声明的 formItems —— 原文只有 title/width 的条目在运行时是空弹窗，与本例 NL「弹窗里的表单也分 2 列」自相矛盾；formSpan:12 同样必须落在弹窗条目上（显式模式的 span 来自条目自己，不再从顶层字段派生）。"
}
